  "data": {
    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Cronos",
    "summary": "When this unit is picked to fight in the Fight phase, or to shoot in your Shooting phase, you may pay 1 Pain token from [Power From Pain](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain) to Empower it.\n\nWhile it is Empowered, each time it finishes resolving its attacks from shooting or fighting, if those attacks **destroyed** at least 1 enemy model, 1 of its models gets back as many as 3 lost wounds. If every one of its models is already at its starting wounds and the unit has fewer models than its **Starting Strength**, return 1 model to it with 3 wounds left instead.",
